"Story","byline":"ESPN staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Hall of Famer Jack Ham returning to broadcast booth after health scare","description":"Hall of Fame linebacker and Penn State radio analyst Jack Ham will return to the broadcast booth on Saturday, just two weeks after suffering a medical emergency.","published":"2026-11-19T19:37:38.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50532925/jack-ham-returning-broadcast-booth-health-scare","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Adam Rittenberg","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"2026 'College GameDay' Week 12: Virginia Tech vs. Miami","description":"\"College GameDay\" heads to University of Miami for Week 12.","published":"2026-11-19T19:27:21.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50532540/2026-college-gameday-week-12-virginia-tech-vs-miami","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Studies: Blood test has potential to detect CTE in the living","description":"A new blood test shows potential to detect advanced stages of chronic traumatic encephalopathy (CTE) in the living, according to two recent published studies.","published":"2026-11-19T22:37:56.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50532686/studies-blood-test-potential-detect-cte-living","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Shwetha Surendran and Mark Fainaru-Wada","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"What we learned about new NC State coach Philip Rivers in Fairhope, Alabama","description":"Rivers, the former NC State and NFL star quarterback, had been coaching high school football for six years.","published":"2026-11-19T12:19:43.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50514617/philip-rivers-nc-state-fairhope-alabama","type":"Story","byline":"Alex Scarborough","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5075540/brice-pollock","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brice_Pollock"},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Brice Pollock","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brice_Pollock","description":"American football player (born 2005)","touched":"2026-11-14T07:37:25Z","intro":"Brice Gabriel Pollock (born March 28, 2005) is an American college football cornerback for the Texas Tech Red Raiders. He previously played for the Mississippi State Bulldogs.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Pollock attended Shiloh High School in Snellville, Georgia. As a senior, he had 61 tackles, two interceptions with a sack and caught 11 passes for 196 yards with four receiving touchdowns. He committed to Mississippi State University to play college football."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"As a freshman at Mississippi State in 2023, Pollock started three of 11 games and recorded 24 tackles. As a junior in 2024, he started all 12 games and had 48 tackles and one interception. After the season, Pollock entered the transfer portal and transferred to Texas Tech University. He was a starter in 2025."}]}}